  <name>en-Master</name>
  <summary>Practise English writing on the text you write</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.tecix">
    <name>Tecix</name>
  </developer>

  <description>
    <p>
      en-Master is a writing coach for people who write English as a second language.
      Select text in any app, press a shortcut, and get a corrected version, every change
      at a glance, and a short explanation of each mistake in your own language.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Actions for coaching, client emails, chat messages, social posts, natural phrasing and Vietnamese to English, plus your own</li>
      <li>A word-by-word view of every change</li>
      <li>A learning log of your mistakes and the phrases you picked up</li>
      <li>Daily drills of your own past mistakes, scheduled with spaced repetition</li>
      <li>Progress over 7, 30 or 90 days, and export to Anki</li>
      <li>Fully usable from the keyboard</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      en-Master uses your ChatGPT plan through “Sign in with ChatGPT”, so no API key is needed.
      Your text is sent to OpenAI only when you run an action.
    </p>
  </description>

